OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,FA fleet of self-driving cars to be
OL,7,Fused by Uber in London have been
OL,8,Fgranted minicab licences.
OL,10,FTechnology company Wayve said
OL,11,FTransport for London (TfL) has awarded
OL,12,Fprivate hire vehicle (PHV) licences to
OL,13,Fa number of its autonomous pure
OL,14,Felectric Ford Mustang Mach-E vehicles.
OL,16,FUber said some of the 100,000 people
OL,17,Fwho signed up to express their
OL,18,Finterest in experiencing robotaxis
OL,19,Fwill be offered rides in the vehicles
OL,20,F"later this summer", ahead of a full
OL,21,Fpublic launch.
OL,26,@|D@AOU|D@SO]
