CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,FA human driver will initially sit
OL,7,Fbehind the wheel ready to take control
OL,8,Fduring journeys, while the technology
OL,9,Fis demonstrated to be safe.
OL,11,FWayve vice president for global
OL,12,Faffairs and assurance, Sarah Gates,
OL,13,Fsaid: "This licence is an important
OL,14,Fstep towards giving Londoners the
OL,15,Fchance to experience autonomous
OL,16,Fdriving technology.
OL,26,@uD@GOU
