OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,F"The responsible deployment of these
OL,7,Fvehicles will bring us safer, cleaner
OL,8,Fand quieter streets, and we're proud
OL,9,Fto continue working alongside
OL,10,Fregulators, communities and the public
OL,11,Fas we take the next steps towards
OL,12,Fmaking autonomous rides a reality in
OL,13,Fthe capital."
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@MO]
