OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,FUber global head of autonomous
OL,7,Fmobility operations Annie Duvnjak
OL,8,Fsaid: "This licence is a key milestone
OL,9,Fin bringing autonomous rides to London
OL,10,Fon Uber.
OL,12,F"Our interest list has seen an
OL,13,Fincredible response from Londoners who
OL,14,Fare excited to experience Wayve's
OL,15,FBritish-built autonomous driving
OL,16,Ftechnology."
OL,26,@pD@GOUtD@AOUxD@LO]
