PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,FA TfL spokesperson said safety is its
OL,7,F"top priority" and any new vehicle
OL,8,Flicensed to carry passengers in London
OL,9,Fmust align with its target of
OL,10,Feliminating all deaths and serious
OL,11,Finjuries on London's roads by 2041.
OL,13,FWayve's modifications to the Mustang
OL,14,FMach-E ` such as its six cameras `
OL,15,Fwere assessed by experts and found
OL,16,F"they do not compromise passenger
OL,17,Fsafety", he added.
OL,19,FA qualified driver must be present and
OL,20,Fremain responsible for the car under
OL,21,Fthe terms of a PHV licence.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@NO]xD@AOUyD@GO]
