PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785932298
OL,3,CLondon self-driving 'robotaxis' win
OL,4,Cminicab licences
OL,6,FUber and Wayve will be required to
OL,7,Fobtain separate approval from the
OL,8,FDriver and Vehicle Standards Agency if
OL,9,Fthey want to operate the cars without
OL,10,Fa driver.
OL,12,FWayve was founded in 2017 by two
OL,13,FUniversity of Cambridge PhD students.
OL,15,FLondon will be the first city in the
OL,16,Fworld to use its technology for
OL,17,Fcommercial journeys.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
